<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard - Sistem Pengelolaan Paket Santri</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
        }
        .navbar {
            background-color: #0d6efd;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .navbar h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        .btn-logout {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: #dc3545;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .container {
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="navbar">
    <h1>Sistem Pengelolaan Paket Santri</h1>
    <a href="/logout" class="btn-logout">Logout</a>
</div>

<div class="container">
    <div class="card">
        <h2>Selamat Datang, <%= nama %>! 👋</h2>
        <p>Anda berhasil login ke sistem menggunakan Node.js dan Express.</p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>